  "text": "9:41¢ all ¥ @\nx\n® deepstash\nfor life 12 rules for life\na jordan peterson\n& 12 ideas + 12 saved see all >\nan y 4\nju “ 2)\n\\\n\nthe lobster principle\nyour posture sends a loud signal to your\nbrain. if you slump, you tell your internal\nsystems that you are at the bottom of the\npile. your body reacts by dropping\nchemicals that regulate mood. you feel\nweaker, so you shrink more. it is a\nbiological spiral into chaos.\nyou snap the loop by taking up space.\nstanding tall exposes your chest and\nthroat to the world. this voluntary risk\nforces your mind to switch from fear to\nfocus. the world treats you like a victor\nonly when you look like one.\n\n© 130k (1) t+ r 14k\n",
